                                                "sense_id": "a08c3064-157b-3627-a742-634905bcef9c",
                                                "text": "‘Observation Officer of the Z12Q, attention!’ snapped from the tight-beam headquarters communicator. ‘Cut off those spy rays and report yourself under arrest for treason!’"
